From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 05:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mac80211: do not resolve an MLD station by its MLD address in RX

ieee80211_rx_for_interface() looks up the sender of a frame that no link
station matches with sta_info_get_bss(), which on an MLD interface finds
an MLO station by its MLD address. The frame then takes the link that
the driver reports or, without one, the link of the receive frequency.
If the station does not hold that link, ieee80211_rx_data_set_link()
fails and the frame is dropped. A non-AP MLD that scans the channel of
another link of its AP MLD sends its Probe Requests from its MLD
address, so the AP MLD does not answer them.

On an MLD interface, resolve the station only by a link address, and
handle a frame from any other address like one from an unknown sender.
On its links a non-AP MLD transmits from its link addresses, and a
non-MLO station of an MLD interface has a link station as well. This is
the rule for such frames of commit 6d531b9af16e ("wifi: mac80211:
rework RX packet handling"), without the rest of that rework.

Fixes: ea9d807b5642 ("wifi: mac80211: add link information in ieee80211_rx_status")
Fixes: 4970e393eb5d ("wifi: mac80211: determine missing link_id in ieee80211_rx_for_interface() based on frequency")
Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
---
--- a/net/mac80211/rx.c
+++ b/net/mac80211/rx.c
@@ -5357,7 +5357,7 @@ static bool ieee80211_rx_for_interface(s
 {
 	struct link_sta_info *link_sta;
 	struct ieee80211_hdr *hdr = (void *)skb->data;
-	struct sta_info *sta;
+	struct sta_info *sta = NULL;
 	int link_id = -1;
 
 	if (ieee80211_is_s1g_beacon(hdr->frame_control)) {
@@ -5380,7 +5380,9 @@ static bool ieee80211_rx_for_interface(s
 	} else {
 		struct ieee80211_rx_status *status = IEEE80211_SKB_RXCB(skb);
 
-		sta = sta_info_get_bss(rx->sdata, hdr->addr2);
+		/* On an MLD interface, only a link address resolves a station */
+		if (!ieee80211_vif_is_mld(&rx->sdata->vif))
+			sta = sta_info_get_bss(rx->sdata, hdr->addr2);
 		if (status->link_valid) {
 			link_id = status->link_id;
 		} else if (ieee80211_vif_is_mld(&rx->sdata->vif) &&
